\\cdot \\text{d}r<0.$\n\n- Statement III is true. It's clear from the picture below that $F$ assists the motion of the particle as it moves from $B$ to $A.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/multivariable/14068563/assets/2287c33ff81973bcaef70917452c97282e0d0dd9ef06141d5beee8b53dec5836.png)\n\n \nSo, ${\\int }_{-C}F\\cdot \\text{d}r>0.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II and III only.\"" 13194139535617 true] [17592186357726 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357727 13194139535617 true] [17592186357726 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357728 13194139535617 true] [17592186357726 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357729 13194139535617 true] [17592186357726 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357730 13194139535617 true] [17592186357726 1000 #edb/ref 17592186357731 13194139535617 true] [17592186357726 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535617 true] [17592186357726 1041 "selection" 13194139535617 true] [17592186357726 1104 #edb/ref 17592186357727 13194139535617 true] [17592186357726 1110 #uuid "a56d3748-13b7-543c-adaa-caa5aae71117" 13194139535617 true] [17592186357727 1034 "II and III only" 13194139535617 true] [17592186357727 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535617 true] [17592186357727 1111 #uuid "2ec6f02b-55af-5961-8387-e2d9d6637e1f" 13194139535617 true] [17592186357728 1034 "I and III only" 13194139535617 true] [17592186357728 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535617 true] [17592186357728 1111 #uuid "7ca5e6df-3e3c-58e2-91c3-5bfc688aa22e" 13194139535617 true] [17592186357729 1034 "I only" 13194139535617 true] [17592186357729 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535617 true] [17592186357729 1111 #uuid "98d340ca-0b1b-537b-882c-0a5cd19a52c8" 13194139535617 true] [17592186357730 1034 "III only" 13194139535617 true] [17592186357730 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045454 13194139535617 true] [17592186357730 1111 #uuid "bd0971a7-a127-5a2b-86de-9df5a0c95f4c" 13194139535617 true] [17592186357731 1034 "II only" 13194139535617 true] [17592186357731 1103 #edb/ref 1759218